good way to spend it

5
00:00:12,207 --> 00:00:13,288
Life may be…

6
00:00:13,328 --> 00:00:15,609
Building a rocket
or fighting a mummy

7
00:00:15,649 --> 00:00:18,090
Or climbing up
the Eiffel Tower

8
00:00:18,331 --> 00:00:20,932
